<div class="email-body">
  <p class="greeting">Hey {{name}}!</p>

  <p>
    Welcome aboard! Your Finishi account is ready and waiting. We're excited to have you join our community of lifelong learners.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-box">
    <p>
      Finishi transforms complex topics into bite-sized, actionable lessons designed around your goals. Learn at your own pace, track your progress, and actually retain what you learn.
    </p>
  </div>

  {{#if skill}}
  <p>
    We've already set up a personalised learning path for you around <span class="badge">{{skill}}</span> — your first lesson is ready and waiting.
  </p>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="cta-wrap">
    <a class="cta" href="{{ctaUrl}}">Start Learning</a>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280;">
    Have questions or need help getting started? Just reply to this email — a real human reads every message.
  </p>
</div>
